window.AKK_THE_BEAUTIFUL_STEPMOTHER_FROM_THE_EIGHTIES_MARRYING_A_FACTORY_DIRECTOR_TO_RAISE_KIDS_CHAPTERS=(window.AKK_THE_BEAUTIFUL_STEPMOTHER_FROM_THE_EIGHTIES_MARRYING_A_FACTORY_DIRECTOR_TO_RAISE_KIDS_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":501,"title":"Chapter 501: Who Ate the Little Strawberries","paragraphs":["But then again, she hadn't known Zhou Yueshen for long back then. She just simply had a good impression of him, taken by his handsome face, without any deep emotional attachment.","Therefore, she couldn't empathize with what Fu Qianqian was feeling.","After Fu Qianqian left, Si Nian went into the room and rummaged around for her and Zhou Yueshen's marriage certificate.","She sighed with emotion, realizing that she had been married for so long and even had her own biological son.","Whatever happened to the promise of pain-free motherhood?","Perhaps it was because of what she had said back then that when she gave birth to Little Four, it actually wasn't too painful. It was all within a bearable range, but Si Nian knew clearly that this was due to her good physical constitution.","For most mothers, giving birth was still an incredibly arduous and agonizing experience.","Otherwise, she wouldn't have been so terrified in the past.","However, when you meet someone you truly love, you might genuinely and willingly bear his children.","It was such a definitive choice.","Si Nian fell into a slight daze. As her fingers traced over the photograph, she suddenly noticed the man's ID number next to it.","Today was his birthday.","Si Nian suddenly rushed out for a bit.","The children hadn't finished school yet, and her parents had both gone to the shop. Little Four claimed he didn't like his father, yet he followed him around all day, putting on the airs of a little boss.","As a result, she was the only one left at home.","Si Nian liked to sleep in every morning, so she usually woke up quite late. By the time she finished her meal, the children would be back at noon.","If Fu Qianqian hadn't shown up at her door bright and early today, she would probably still be sleeping.","When the children returned, they saw Si Nian bustling about in the kitchen.","Ever since Eldest Child's cooking skills had become increasingly exquisite, and with Mother Lin also being here, Si Nian rarely spent time cooking.","Today was a rare occasion for her to cook.","Zhou Zedong's eyes flickered, and he went into the kitchen to help.","\"Mom, are you cooking today?\"","Si Nian hummed in agreement, in a good mood.","Zhou Zedong was already in his first year of middle school at the best First Middle School in the city center. He wore a light black tracksuit, dressed entirely in black, with his hair cut very short, looking clean and sharp.","His dark eyes were astonishingly bright, already giving off the vibe of an aloof, top-tier student on campus.","Only when he called her \"Mom\" did Si Nian feel that he was still just a child.","\"I'll help you.\"","He didn't know what special day it was, but seeing Si Nian so happy, he figured it must be a good day.","He went to change his clothes and entered the kitchen to help wash the vegetables.","Second Child was leading Jiang Jiu in practicing martial arts in the courtyard. His punches were now quite imposing, and he really couldn't stand Jiang Jiu's frail and delicate appearance.","Just today at school, Jiang Jiu had argued with a girl and even got pushed to the ground!","Second Child felt this damaged his own prestige. He was furious and determined to train Jiang Jiu.","Jiang Jiu was always a three-minute wonder with whatever he did. Seeing him learn, Jiang Jiu wanted to learn too, but since they hadn't lived together before, his efforts were sporadic at best, and he ended up learning nothing.","Now, he couldn't even hold a horse stance for a few minutes before his legs started trembling. He looked like he was struggling immensely.","Yaoyao was already a little lady, and she had recently fallen in love with planting. Every day, she followed her grandparents to study how to grow vegetables and fruits.","The courtyard was filled with car tires, foam boxes, and some flower pots, all piled high with soil.","She was currently watering her strawberry plant. It wasn't growing very well and had only borne three fruits. One was large and had already turned white, while the other two were misshapen. Regardless, it wasn't thriving.","The first thing she did every day upon returning home was to check when her strawberries would turn red.","Yaoyao stared at them for a long while before leaving, completely satisfied.","Second Child led Jiang Jiu running past, but suddenly Second Child stopped.","\"Second Brother, what's wrong?\"","\"Look, a strawberry,\" Second Child said, pointing at the fruit.","Jiang Jiu looked over as well. Sweating profusely from running, he suddenly felt thirsty and couldn't help but swallow hard.","\"No, no, we can't eat it. We definitely can't eat it; little sister planted this.\" Clearly, Second Child also wanted to eat it very much, but he didn't dare.","His sister was terrifying when she got mad.","Not daring to look any longer, he hurriedly pulled Jiang Jiu away.","Da Huang had recently realized that he was no longer young and had started to lose weight. Especially after Xiao Hua arrived, he paid even more attention to his appearance.","He had been running along with them, but seeing the two stop and go, he trotted over as well. He spotted a little white thing, sniffed it, and found it smelled rather fragrant.","It seemed edible.","Da Huang bit it off in one gulp, happily carried it in his mouth over to Xiao Hua's nest, and nudged it toward her with his paw.","Then, he turned and walked away with an air of aloof coolness."]},{"number":502,"title":"Chapter 502: Prove Yourself","paragraphs":["Mom, Mom, my strawberry is almost red! Yaoyao was thrilled, running into the house to share her achievement with Si Nian.","Hearing this, Si Nian smiled and said, Isn't that a good thing?","Si Nian felt that Yaoyao probably didn't have much talent for such delicate work, but the little girl simply loved it. The more she struggled with it, the more she liked it.","Previously, they had given her a potted cactus, and she had drowned it by overwatering.","She had even cried secretly at night over it.","After that, she began to work hard and study diligently under the guidance of her grandpa and grandma.","This strawberry seedling was something Zhou Yueshen had dug up from who knows where and brought back for her to plant.","It had been so long, and it had finally borne fruit.","Mhm! Yaoyao nodded her little head vigorously. The biggest one is for you, Mom!","Si Nian smiled and patted her head, acknowledging her sweet gesture.","Seeing that her mother was busy, Yaoyao felt bad asking her to go look at it, so she trotted outside with the intention of carrying the pot inside to show Si Nian.","But as soon as she went out, she discovered that her biggest strawberry was gone!","Ah!","A piercing scream startled Second Child and the other boy who had just run outside, making them shudder and nearly trip.","Si Nian and Zhou Zedong hurried out, their faces full of concern as they asked what was wrong.","Crying, Yaoyao said, Mom, my strawberry is gone.","Just as she finished speaking, she saw Second Child walking in. Realizing something, she immediately shouted, Second Brother definitely stole it and ate it!","Because she had seen it before, her second brother often sneaked food, and he ate a lot!","He was the most gluttonous person in the family.","He was just standing there, yet blame fell from the sky.","Second Child jumped. Seeing the stern looks from his mother and eldest brother, he immediately grew anxious. It wasn't me, Mom! I didn't eat it. I really didn't.","When I walked past just now, I did see it and I wanted to eat it, but I didn't!","Yaoyao was already heartbroken and couldn't listen to reason. She felt that no one else but her second brother would eat her little strawberry.","Jiang Jiu also hurriedly chimed in, Sister Yaoyao, it's true. Second Brother didn't eat it. I saw him.","Yaoyao was so sad that she ignored both of them, wiping her tears as she ran back into the house.","Seeing her like this, it seemed impossible to coax her. The two boys felt their heads throbbing with a headache.","They looked helplessly at Si Nian for help.","Si Nian also felt a headache coming on.","Honestly, if Second Child had really stolen Yaoyao's little strawberry, she would definitely be very angry too. After all, the little girl had put her heart into it. It had finally borne fruit with great difficulty, so how could she not be sad if someone ate it?","At first, when she saw it was missing, she had also suspected Second Child a little.","But seeing him anxiously explaining without any guilt, she knew the boy probably hadn't eaten it.","Although he always loved to bicker with his sister, it was only because he was jealous that she treated their older brother better than him. He wouldn't go as far as stealing her strawberry to get back at her.","He didn't have that kind of scheming mind.","It was even more impossible for Jiang Jiu. He was a well-behaved child, and Si Nian wouldn't suspect him.","She and Eldest Child hadn't left the house, so it couldn't have been them either.","Could someone have sneaked in and picked it while they weren't around?","Impossible, impossible. They had two dogs tied up at home.","Who would dare come in?","Dogs?","Wait a minute.","Si Nian looked over at the two lazy dogs. Both were lying down resting.","She walked over, her gaze sweeping past them, and suddenly noticed half a bitten strawberry that was completely mangled.","Well, case closed.","The children also ran over. Seeing that Xiao Hua had eaten it, Second Child widened his eyes and wanted to scold the dog. But seeing Xiao Hua looking up at him with an innocent and bewildered expression, he couldn't bring himself to curse.","He hurried into the house to find Yaoyao and prove his innocence.","Yaoyao had cried until her little eyes were red. Hearing that Xiao Hua had eaten it, she still didn't believe it.","She said with a firm face, Xiao Hua is not like that.","But the truth hit her hard. The strawberry that Xiao Hua had taken two bites out of, if it wasn't hers, whose could it be?","Yaoyao was heartbroken and in disbelief.","She started crying again.","Xiao Hua came over and licked her hand, as if trying to comfort her.","In no time, she was amused and started giggling.","Second Child was speechless. He waited for ages for her to get mad, and instead, she laughed!","This was valuing the dog over her brother!","He was angry!","He was totally innocent, okay?","However, Second Child wasn't upset for long. All the children were soon attracted by the cake Si Nian was making.","Only then did they learn that today was their father's birthday.","No wonder Mom was cooking today and looking so happy.","Everyone immediately forgot their unhappiness and got busy helping out.","They said they wanted to give Dad a surprise.","Zhou Yueshen came back late. He often had social engagements, going out to eat and drink. Sometimes he couldn't get away and would be busy until eleven or twelve at night.","But now that he was close to home, no matter how late it was, he would always come back.","Today he was lucky. Because he had brought a child with him, the others couldn't say much, so the gathering ended early.","When he returned, it wasn't even ten o'clock yet.","His son, held in his arms, was already fast asleep.","Zhou Yueshen hadn't wanted to take him along, but the little guy was bored when he woke up in the morning and couldn't disturb his mother's sleep, so he clung to his father and refused to let him go.","Left with no choice, Zhou Yueshen had to take him.","Fortunately, Little Ze wasn't a noisy child. When he was tired, he would sleep on his own without needing anyone to coax him, sleeping wherever he was placed."]},{"number":503,"title":"Chapter 503: From the Beginning to the Very End (Text Complete)","paragraphs":["He was very easy to take care of.","Zhou Yueshen also had an easy time.","However, he was also the only man who took his son everywhere he went, and he could always feel the strange looks from others.","Zhou Yueshen didn't pay it any mind, though.","Just as he parked the car and walked into the house, he suddenly paused and slowed his steps.","All the lights in the house were off. Were they already asleep?","Going to bed so early today?","Feeling a bit puzzled, he walked inside.","The moment he pulled open the door and stepped inside, there was a pop, and confetti rained down on his head just as the lights flicked on.","The children were holding a small cake, grinning at him. \"Happy birthday, Dad!\"","Little Four jolted and almost fell. Before he even had time to cry, he noticed his older brothers and sisters holding a small cake, and his eyes immediately widened.","Coming to his senses, Zhou Yueshen didn't know whether to laugh or cry. \"What is all this?\"","Si Nian was holding a bouquet of flowers. It was obvious she had dressed up especially for today. Her long black hair was slightly curled and draped over her shoulders, and she wore a dress. With just the right amount of makeup, she looked incredibly charming and radiant.","His eyes flickered, and he set down his son, who was kicking his little legs, eager to see the cake.","Si Nian stepped forward with the flowers and handed them to him. \"Happy birthday, Zhou Yueshen.\"","Zhou Yueshen couldn't hide the smile in his eyes. He had never received anything like this before. He hadn't cared in the past, but now, he felt a subtle shift in his mood, his heart incredibly full.","Leaving nothing but warmth.","He pulled Si Nian into his arms and took the flowers. \"What made you think of celebrating my birthday?\"","\"I just wanted to, no other reason.\"","Zhou Yueshen chuckled softly and lowered his head to kiss her forehead. \"Thank you. Sorry for making you all wait so late.\"","He had thought they were all asleep.","He didn't expect them to be holding back a big surprise.","Zhou Yueshen felt that all the exhaustion of the day vanished completely in this moment.","\"Who are you being so polite to?\" Si Nian reached out and pinched him.","Zhou Yueshen chuckled softly and didn't tease her further.","Everyone hadn't eaten yet; they had specifically waited for Zhou Yueshen to have dinner. However, because it was so late, they didn't eat much. After the meal, the children came over one by one to give him their gifts. They were all small items, and Zhou Yueshen accepted them all.","It was already very late by the time they finished eating. Waiting up all evening had indeed been exhausting for them, especially the children who still had classes. Usually, they would be asleep by nine at the latest.","They cut the cake early on. After eating it and the excitement wore off, the children began yawning repeatedly. Si Nian told them to hurry up and go to bed.","It was fine for her to stay up late, but she couldn't let the children get into the habit of it.","Now, it was just the two of them.","The living room lights were soft, and a drama was playing on the TV, but neither of them was paying attention to it.","Si Nian leaned against the man's shoulder, looking at their intertwined hands, her heart full.","She mentioned, \"Today Fu Qianqian came to tell me that she and Yu Dong might be getting married soon. She was so happy and asked me what day would be good, which made me think of when we got married.\"","So she went to look at their marriage certificate and noticed his birthday.","She thought she would take the initiative for once. When they got married, he had taken care of everything. It was her first time getting married, and Si Nian had been completely clueless and didn't understand anything.","Zhou Yueshen paused slightly, also recalling that time. The memory was deeply ingrained, as if it were just yesterday.","But thinking about it carefully, several years had already passed.","It turned out they had already been by each other's side for so long.","His grip on Si Nian's hand tightened. \"Were you happy back then?\"","Si Nian thought about it carefully, a bit uncertain. \"I guess I was happy.\"","It sounded exceptionally forced.","Zhou Yueshen chuckled softly. \"It seems I didn't satisfy you enough.\"","Si Nian glared at him. \"You don't even consider how long we had known each other back then. To be honest, I was still a bit bewildered. When we got married, I even wondered what I would do if you turned into a completely different person after marriage.\"","Zhou Yueshen felt a bit guilty.","\"I was too abrupt.\"","It had been rushed at the time, mainly because she had already moved over. If he didn't give her a proper title, even as a fiancee, how would outsiders gossip about her living in his house every day without being married?","Si Nian climbed right up the pole he handed her. \"Back then, you were aloof, didn't like coming home, didn't like talking, and only knew how to give me money to spend.\"","Zhou Yueshen had been even busier back then, staying at the pig farm all day working. He would come back late at night and leave early in the morning.","Sometimes, the number of sentences they exchanged in a day could be counted on one hand.","Sometimes, she wouldn't see him for days.","Recalling it now, Si Nian felt wronged.","Of course, she hadn't felt that way at the time.","\"I'm sorry.\"","Hearing her say that, Zhou Yueshen also felt he had been quite a jerk.","\"But it felt really nice back then. When you kissed me, you were always so reckless,\" Si Nian added with a smile.","They were still in their ambiguous phase back then. Their occasional meetings were filled with constant tension and borderline flirtations.","An occasional kiss.","It was enough to make hearts race and faces blush.","Now that they were an old married couple, kissing had become a routine occurrence.","Zhou Yueshen's Adam's apple bobbed.","His voice lowered a bit. \"Is that so? Did Nian Nian like that feeling?\"","Si Nian blushed and changed the subject. \"I wanted to ask, did you kiss me back then because you liked me, or because I was pretty?\"","She didn't forget to boast about herself.","Zhou Yueshen's eyes held a smile.","\"Because I liked you.\"","Si Nian rarely heard these words from his mouth, and her heart pounded wildly.","Feeling a bit smug again, she said, \"So you liked me that early on.\"","Zhou Yueshen looked at her. \"What about you?\"","\"Me?\" Si Nian said in an exaggerated tone. \"Just a little bit, only a little bit.\"","She couldn't let him get too full of himself.","Zhou Yueshen wasn't angry either.","\"And now?\"","\"Now?\" Si Nian paused.","She looked up at the man, meeting his eyes. The flickering light from the TV reflected in his eyes, breaking into tiny, shimmering fragments.","\"What about you?\"","Zhou Yueshen's deep eyes gazed down at Si Nian as he said softly, \"I love you, Nian Nian. I love you very much.\"","A smile rose in Si Nian's eyes. She looped her arms around the man's neck, leaning in close to his ear. \"Me too.\"","Zhou Yueshen, I love you too.","From the very beginning, and from start to finish.","(End of Main Story)","Actually, there is so much everyone wants to read about, like the children growing up, the two of them falling in love... But I realize that these are everyday developments that have happened many times. If I really wrote them all, it would be endless, and you would get tired of reading it.","I think their story is already very complete here, and their future won't be bad no matter what. Continuing to write would just be dragging it out with filler (even though it's been pretty filled with fluff before).","Honestly, it's my fault. I rarely write such long stories. Before 300,000 words, this book was at its prime, but after that, it wasn't written as well. From the backend retention data, I know that only about one in a hundred people followed it to the end. The readers who stayed are the motivation that kept me writing. Whenever I doubted myself, everyone comforted me and gave me the courage to continue. However, due to my lack of writing skill, the absence of an outline, and my poor experience, the flaws became more obvious as the word count grew.","I also feel terrible for not providing a perfectly satisfying ending for everyone. I don't know how to write it to make it the best. I hope everyone can be gentle with their criticism. If there's anything you want to read, you can leave it in the comments. I can still write 100,000 words of side stories after the main story ends, and I will try my best to make it complete.","Finally—","Thank you all for your support along the way. See you around if fate permits!"]},{"number":504,"title":"Chapter 504: Extra Story 1: The Original Si Nian and Fu Yang","paragraphs":["In her past life, Si Nian had always had a dream. In the dream, she fell in love with a military officer at first sight, poured her heart and soul out to him, and eventually became his wife, living a sweet and happy life.","But reality was cruel. Not only did she fail to become his wife, but she also turned out to be a Fake Heiress. When the True Heiress came knocking, her parents wanted to kick her out, even forcing her to marry an old, divorced pig farmer from the countryside who had three children.","She thought her fiance would help her, believing that even without love, there would still be some affection between them. But in the end, the man refused to even see her. Disheartened and in despair, she chose death.","Now, she was reborn and returned to the time before the college entrance examination.","She would no longer take the initiative to bring him all kinds of delicious food, nor would she give up her studies for him, let alone want to go to the university he once attended. As for this fiance, she was done serving him.","However, at a gathering in the family compound, he blocked her path in confusion, his tone heavy: \"Why are you ignoring me?\"","\"Don't you have your own things to do?\"","A cold and displeased voice rang in her ears. The tone was indifferent, carrying a hint of impatience, chilling to the bone.","It was both familiar and strange.","An aching pain instantly welled up in her chest.","Si Nian blinked hard, and the blurry scene before her eyes became clear.","What came into view was him in his military uniform, which further accentuated his tough, solid, tall, and slender physique.","He had a bad temper, one could even say it was foul. After saying one sentence, he lost his patience, \"Move out of the way.\"","The people around them were whispering among themselves, but no one dared to say anything to his face. They all cast sidelong glances at the young and tall Battalion Commander Fu.","The battalion commander was still as cold as ever. Although he was young and promising, no one could catch his eye.","Even the Belle of the Compound, his fiancee Si Nian, was no exception. She failed to receive even a trace of his tenderness.","Si Nian: \"......\"","She snapped back to reality, raising her eyes only to meet a pair of deep, cold eyes.","He was looking down at her from high above.","In the past, she was always shy and dared not look up to meet the man's gaze.","But now, she saw it clearly. In the man's eyes, there was no reflection of her.","Because they were too close, Si Nian took two steps back. The soup in her hands crashed to the ground with a clatter, shattering all over the floor.","The scalding hot soup splashed onto her black pearl leather shoes, making her look a bit disheveled.","The commotion was so loud that everyone stared at her in surprise.","Si Nian looked at the once familiar scene and those surprised faces, her eyes widening in disbelief.","Wasn't this the time before her college entrance examination?","Was she reborn?","Reborn and returned to the time before the college entrance exam?","She remembered clearly that half a month before the exam, she heard that Fu Yang had returned, so she hurriedly stewed some soup and went to visit him.","However, she was openly despised by Fu Yang, losing all her face.","She originally wanted to tell him that she was about to take the college entrance exam, and her first choice was the university he once attended, which was also her dream.","She wanted to tell him in person that she was not just a pretty vase, and that she could also get into an excellent university.","Yet the man did not give her a chance to speak. His coldness and disgust made her lose all face in the family compound, leaving her devastated.","When her parents heard about this, and also heard that Fu Yang was about to be promoted, they worried that he would look down on her more and more, so they urged the two families to get married as soon as possible.","And because of the marriage, they made her give up taking the college entrance exam.","They said that even if she got into a university, she wouldn't meet anyone better than Fu Yang.","Going to college would take four years.","Fu Yang was not getting any younger, and it was impossible for him to be willing to wait for her.","The two of them already spent little time together in the family compound, and it would be even more impossible to see each other once she left.","By then, he would also have a reason to break off the engagement with her.","Si Nian had fallen in love with him at first sight since childhood and had waited for more than ten years.","Her parents' urging made her lose her rationality as well.","She actually agreed to give up the college entrance exam and chose to get married.","However, her actions did not bear fruit.","Instead, it brought a painful price for her future.","It wouldn't be long before the True Heiress returned.","She would be abandoned by her parents and kicked out of the family compound. From being the excellent Belle of the Compound, surrounded by stars since childhood, she would eventually have to marry a country man and become a stepmother to several children.","Unable to accept this, Si Nian chose to commit suicide, but she didn't expect to open her eyes and find herself back before the college entrance exam.","The man coldly pursed his lips and squinted at her. In this short time, Fu Yang actually saw emotions of grief and shock on her face.","He frowned slightly, not saying a word.","Si Nian found it hard to believe. She never thought that despite her desperate efforts since childhood to become the most outstanding girl in the compound, the face of her school, and a girl praised by everyone, she would ultimately end up with such a tragic fate.","And all of this was because of the man in front of her.","She suddenly clenched her fists and lowered her eyes to look at the shattered soup container on the ground. Bending down, under the astonished gazes of the crowd, she picked up the broken pieces one by one with trembling hands.","Her fingers were cut, and blood flowed down, but she seemed not to feel it.","Her hands were stained with the completely cold soup, mixed with the smell of blood, which was really not pleasant.","But she didn't care at all. By the time she stood up, her bright and beautiful face had returned to calmness.","She looked at the frowning man in front of her, paused for a moment, and when she opened her mouth again, she shocked everyone present.","\"Fu Yang, let's break off the engagement.\"","After speaking, Si Nian did not look to see what kind of expression he had. She had a second chance, she was back. In this life, she could start over and would not ruin her life for a man again.","She would not fight with the True Heiress; everything of hers would be returned to her.","And Fu Yang too..."]},{"number":505,"title":"Chapter 505: Extra Story 2: Fu Yang and Si Nian","paragraphs":["After Si Nian was reborn, her parents indeed became anxious.","The fact that she had mentioned breaking off the engagement that day had already caused such a stir that the entire family compound knew about it.","Si's Father and Si's Mother were furious, pointing at her forehead and scolding her incessantly.","However, Si Nian was solely focused on her studies. In this life, she would no longer think about going to Fu Yang's school. She wanted to work harder, leave this city, and get into the best universities, Jinghua or Qinghua.","She wanted to stay far away from all of this.","Her fate in her previous life had been too tragic. She had lost her education and lost him.","She couldn't swallow her pride to marry into a rural village.","She felt as if she had been abandoned by the whole world.","That was why she had chosen death.","But in this life, she still had a choice. In the few days since her rebirth, her mind had been incredibly clear, and she realized that she could perfectly well live without him.","Fu Yang had been staying in the family compound these past few days. Hearing that the two of them had fallen out, quite a few girls who admired him were looking for opportunities to visit him.","Only Si Nian remained completely quiet.","Seeing that she wouldn't listen to their advice, Si's Father and Si's Mother had no choice but to go over personally to mediate.","Fortunately, Father Fu and Mother Fu knew their son's character and did not blame Si Nian.","Moreover, they believed that marriage was not a trifling matter, and it was impossible to just break off an engagement because the two kids had an argument.","Si Nian naturally understood this logic very well.","So when she said that to Fu Yang at the time, she was purely telling herself that she would no longer pursue him.","As for the marriage, since she wasn't the biological daughter of the Si family, it would naturally be carried on by their real daughter.","When that time came, however the two of them developed their relationship would be none of her business.","By then, the college entrance examination would be long over, and she wouldn't be coming back anyway.","Fu Yang had been feeling somewhat restless these past few days.","In his dreams, he would constantly see the scene from that day.","Si Nian's eyes told him that this time, she wasn't just acting out of anger, nor was she deliberately trying to provoke him as a joke.","She was serious.","It wasn't as if she hadn't been angry at his attitude in the past.","But seeing no reaction from him, she would usually give in and show weakness after three days at most.","At those times, he would give her an out; after all, having known each other for so many years, Fu Yang wouldn't push things too far.","But this time, a long while had passed, and even when a message came from the military base asking him to return for a mission, he still hadn't seen her come to his door again.","Fu Yang felt an inexplicable sense of panic in his heart.","He couldn't quite describe the feeling.","He believed that he didn't like a girl like Si Nian.","He liked girls who were his equal, with strong, vibrant personalities, not someone like her who relied on her pretty face and clung to him relentlessly.","Therefore, when he saw his sister coming in with some soup, a hint of disappointment and disdain crossed his face. He had thought that she would hold out for a few more days this time.","He waved his hand dismissively. Deal with it yourself, I don't like drinking it.","Unexpectedly, Fu Qianqian waved her hand with a look of disgust. I don't want it. This doesn't taste anywhere near as good as what Si Nian makes. Eat it yourself.","His movement to stand up paused, and he raised his eyes to glance at his sister.","Frowning, he asked, What did you say?","Fu Qianqian was confused. What do you mean, what?","Fu Yang glanced at the soup in her hands. Who sent it?","Fu Qianqian said, Who else but those social butterflies you attracted? After saying that, she added worriedly, Brother, you're not really going to break off the engagement with Si Nian, are you? Even if you do, you can't possibly fancy these girls. Their cooking isn't even as good as Si Nian's. Take this one today, for example. I clearly saw it being packed from the state-run restaurant, yet she insisted she made it herself. She wanted to copy Si Nian and show affection, but didn't even bother to do it herself. So hypocritical, tsk.","I'm not trying to lecture you, but even though I don't like Si Nian, she treats you the best out of everyone in our compound. Don't take your blessings for granted, or you might regret it later.","After saying that, under her brother's murderous glare, Fu Qianqian quickly scurried away.","Fu Yang's expression was ugly.","...","Si Nian was just putting on her backpack, preparing to return to school. This time, she was carrying some luggage. Over the past few days, Si's Father and Si's Mother had been pointing at her and scolding her daily, frustrated at her failure to meet their expectations. Because they had raised her, she couldn't talk back.","So, in order not to let it affect her studies, she planned to apply to stay in the school dormitories for a while. Her standing at school was quite good, and both the teachers and the principal valued her highly.","Many students also chose to board at school to avoid any delays in their college entrance exam preparations. Therefore, if she applied now, as long as there was an empty bed, she would definitely be able to move in.","That was why she had packed some clothes to change into.","Today happened to be Monday, and she left the house early.","As soon as she walked out of the family compound's gate, a tall and lean young man appeared beside her.","He was wearing glasses and a backpack. He was quite tall, and upon seeing her, he blushed slightly and stammered, Si... Si Nian.","Si Nian turned her head to look and saw that it was a schoolmate. He was a top student, and because of that, the two of them had even hosted an event together before.","Year-round, the two of them always ranked first and second.","However, because her mind used to be entirely focused on Fu Yang, she had never paid him much attention.","She only vaguely remembered that such a person existed.","When passing by him on a normal day, she would at most nod in greeting.","Seeing him striking up a conversation with her now, she was a bit surprised. Hello, Classmate Song. Is there something you need?","The college entrance exam is coming up, and I... I wanted to ask which university you plan to go to. I, I don't mean anything else, it's just...","Before he could even finish his sentence, his face had already turned completely red.","For young men in this era, just talking to a girl required a great deal of courage.","Si Nian was actually quite reserved at school. Many people pursued her, but because she had a fiancé, she deliberately acted aloof and avoided contact with them.","Thinking back on it now, she couldn't help but sigh in lament.","I plan to go to Jinghua University. What about you?","His eyes lit up, and he immediately said, I, I am too. It's just that my English isn't as good as yours. I, I'm a bit worried... Could, could I please ask you to...","Si Nian thought about it carefully. In her previous life, she hadn't taken the college entrance exam, but someone had indeed asked her which school she was going to. At that time, she had unhesitatingly said that she was going to the university Fu Yang had attended.","She only remembered that later, after the exam results came out, no one from their high school went to Jinghua University.","Could it be because of this that he didn't get in either?","Realizing that her math wasn't as good as his and that she was currently at a loss about it, Si Nian's eyes suddenly darted around, and she smiled brightly. My math isn't very good either. How about this: you help me tutor math, and I'll help you with English? Let's get into Jinghua University together?","Before she finished speaking, she suddenly felt a chill in the air around her.","She subconsciously glanced to the side, only to see Fu Yang's car parked not far away.","She paused for a moment, but the boy didn't notice. Hearing her words, he was pleasantly surprised and nodded repeatedly.","Seeing that she was carrying things and it looked inconvenient, he immediately offered, I, let me help you. I'm going to school too, let's walk together.","In the past, Si Nian would avoid this kind of boy like the plague, terrified of people pointing fingers and gossiping.","But now, she didn't care anymore.","Why should Fu Yang have people fawning over him every day, bringing him food and drinks, while she had to restrict herself with all these rules and make things difficult for herself?","So she was happy to take it easy. Just as she was about to hand her things over, the car unexpectedly drove over.","An icy voice came from inside the car: Get in, I'll take you to school.","Si Nian paused, not looking at him.","Meanwhile, the boy beside her looked over in astonishment. Upon seeing Fu Yang, he felt a bit awkward.","He knew about Si Nian's situation, but he had heard a few days ago that the two of them had a falling out.","That was why he finally gathered his courage.","But he didn't expect...","Worried that he might be misunderstood, he looked at Si Nian apologetically.","Si Nian smiled brightly at him and generously handed the items over. \"Sorry to trouble you, Classmate Song. My hands were just starting to hurt from carrying this.\"","\"Let's go. We should hurry to school to study, so we won't bother Comrade Fu to make a trip.\" She appeared extremely sensible and polite.","In her heart, she thought: Heh, men will only slow down my studying speed.","The boy breathed a sigh of relief and quickly nodded.","With that said, ignoring Fu Yang's murderous glare, the two walked shoulder to shoulder toward the bus stop.","Uncle Liu was so awkward that his toes were practically curling against the brake pedal. \"Hahaha, Comrade Si Nian is truly a good child who loves to study. I heard before that she has excellent grades, and she even told everyone that she would work hard to get into the university you attended. What an impressive kid.\"","Fu Yang suddenly glanced at him. \"Get into my university?\"","Uncle Liu nodded. \"Yeah, didn't you know? I heard it all from my daughter. She is in the same class as Comrade Si Nian, and she said Si Nian studies incredibly hard just to get into the university you went to.\"","Fu Yang pursed his lips. That day, when he came downstairs, the discussion between Si's Father, Si's Mother, and his own parents was still fresh in his mind.","Hearing them say that Si Nian could skip the university entrance exams and get married early, he had been filled with disdain at the time.","That someone would willingly give up their education just to get married was something he truly couldn't understand. Did these women really need to cling to connections so desperately that they couldn't live without a man?","Did they have no independent thoughts or opinions of their own?","Fu Yang had scoffed at this.","He had grown even more disdainful, even thinking that if the engagement could really be broken off, it wouldn't be a bad thing.","But now, hearing Uncle Liu's words, his mood became somewhat complicated.","He even recalled that day when she had excitedly come to find him and mentioned school matters, only to be interrupted by him before she could finish.","Could it be that she had just wanted to tell him about taking the university entrance exams?","A wave of guilt washed over Fu Yang's heart.","The irritation he felt from being ignored by Si Nian just moments ago also dissipated.","\"What time does she finish class?\"","\"Four-thirty, or was it five-thirty?\" Uncle Liu hadn't been to school in many years and couldn't remember clearly.","\"Mm. We will go pick her up then.\"","Uncle Liu said, \"Alright... wait, what?\""]},{"number":506,"title":"Chapter 506: Extra Episode: Fu Yang and Si Nian","paragraphs":["In the afternoon.","Fu Yang finally had some free time.","Originally, he had planned to ask Uncle Liu to pick up Si Nian.","But the more he thought about it, the more he felt he had crossed a line by disrespecting her in front of everyone in the family compound.","Regardless of what their future held or whether they would end up together, they had grown up together after all. When he was younger and naive, he had treated her as his favorite girl.","Even though Si Nian hadn't grown up to be the person he imagined and had repeatedly disappointed him.","He still shouldn't have treated her like that.","He recalled that her hand seemed to be bleeding that day.","The little girl who used to need coaxing just to take her medicine was now no longer afraid of pain.","He wondered if it was serious.","With these thoughts in mind, Fu Yang personally went to the school gates.","Knowing Si Nian's personality, he wouldn't even need to apologize. Just seeing him come to visit her in person would probably make her instantly forget her anger from that day.","Ultimately, it was his family pushing him too hard that made him so tense.","To think he had actually argued so seriously with a girl.","Fu Yang gave a faint, self-deprecating smile.","The car was parked at the school gate, and he watched waves of high school students pouring out.","From time to time, people cast curious glances his way.","He waited for an unknown amount of time.","The relaxed expression on Fu Yang's face gradually tightened. His gaze unconsciously swept over the school gate as he asked Uncle Liu, Do you see her yet?","Uncle Liu shook his head, Not yet. I haven't seen the Si Nian girl.","He muttered a moment later, Almost everyone is gone. Why haven't we seen her?","Fu Yang frowned as well, but he still said, She might have been delayed by cleaning duties. Let's wait a bit longer.","He was uncharacteristically patient today.","Uncle Liu was somewhat surprised.","At that moment, Fu Qianqian walked out of the school. Seeing Fu Yang's car, she was pleasantly surprised.","Brother, why are you here? You actually came to pick me up from school? Has the sun risen in the west?","She was thrilled. After her initial joy, she said smugly, Ha, that wretched girl Si Nian is boarding at school now. I was wondering why she would choose to live at school, but this is great, she can't hitch a ride in your car anymore. If she knew you came today but missed seeing you, she'd probably be furious.","She spoke with obvious schadenfreude.","Clearly, she had already planned to use this to mock Si Nian the next day.","Fu Yang's brow darkened, Si Nian is boarding at school?","Yeah, didn't she tell you? Fu Qianqian huffed out a breath. She always felt stifled knowing she couldn't compare to Si Nian in any aspect.","Fortunately, Si Nian was obsessed with her brother and stubbornly threw herself at him, otherwise, Qianqian really wouldn't have been able to find mental balance.","Fu Yang couldn't describe the feeling in his heart.","She hadn't told him.","In the past, no matter what Si Nian did, big or small, she would always tell him first.","Although Fu Yang felt she lacked her own opinions and generally didn't pay much attention, if it was something important, he would still offer a few words of advice.","But he never expected Si Nian to suddenly move into the school dorms.","Why?","He had returned, yet she had moved out?","This wasn't like something she would do.","The person who used to chatter and cling to him had suddenly distanced herself.","Logically, Si Nian should be the one feeling unaccustomed to this.","But at this moment, a sense of discomfort welled up in Fu Yang's heart.","He initially hadn't wanted to return to the family compound because he was tired of his family urging him to marry and her constant clinging.","He deeply regretted agreeing to this marriage when they were young just because she was pretty.","However, Fu Yang was never one to show weakness.","He had swallowed his pride this time, and since she didn't cherish it, there wouldn't be a next time.","Ignoring that empty feeling, he buried himself back in his work.","To him, making contributions in his career was the most important thing.","Being busy like this, another half a month passed.","By the time he realized it, the students had already started preparing for the college entrance examination.","Because Fu Qianqian was also taking the exam, it was a major event for the Fu family.","So Fu Yang took some time out to visit home.","Yet he heard that Si Nian hadn't been back for over half a month.","Si's Father and Si's Mother were furious, even threatening to sever ties if she remained disobedient.","Given Si Nian's level of filial piety, she should have been the first to yield.","But not only did she not yield, she hadn't even met with her family.","The Si family had made up their minds not to let Si Nian take the college entrance examination.","Because they didn't want her to go to college, fearing that their golden ticket of a son-in-law, Fu Yang, would be snatched away by someone else.","But the usually obedient Si Nian seemed determined to oppose them this time.","Not only did she refuse to listen, but she also refused to even see them.","In a fit of rage, Si's Father and Si's Mother cut off her living expenses.","They were just waiting for Si Nian to come back and submit on her own.","Who knew that half a month would pass without her giving in at all.","Fu Yang was quite surprised when he heard this vivid account from Fu Qianqian.","He hadn't expected Si Nian to be this stubborn.","This was the first time since he had known her that she had rebelled against her family.","But he didn't dislike it. Although he disliked her clinging, they had grown up together after all, and he also hoped Si Nian could get into a good university and have her own future.","Conversely, if she really listened to her parents and insisted on marrying him, Fu Yang would actually look down on her.","However, what concerned him more was that she was just a high school student; without her family's financial support, how could she survive?","To this, Fu Qianqian said unwillingly, She's quite smart. She's working as a tutor, helping others review for the college entrance exam, and making quite a bit of money.","Because Si Nian was already quite an excellent student at school, and her English was top-notch, which happened to be the subject most people struggled with.","When Si Nian suddenly extended an olive branch offering help, naturally, a bunch of people sought her out.","Hearing this, Fu Yang was stunned again.","So, she didn't need his worry.","As this thought popped into his mind, Fu Yang suddenly broke out in a cold sweat, feeling like he was losing his mind.","Why should he worry about her?","Father Fu and Mother Fu were also very surprised by Si Nian's behavior.","However, after she had studied for so many years, it was impossible for them to tell her to stop her education just to marry their son.","They couldn't do such a thing.","So they also respected Si Nian's decision.","Before the college entrance examination, Si Nian focused entirely on making preparations.","Preparing for the exam, in this life, she gave up on men, solely to achieve the best life for herself.","During this time, she also made several friends, all of whom were excellent.","Unlike her, who had been completely infatuated with a man at such a young age.","Si Nian finally realized that in the prime of her youth, she had chosen romance and given up the youth she should have enjoyed.","The college entrance exam came fiercely and went quickly.","Although Si's Father and Si's Mother disapproved, they cared about their reputation and couldn't bring themselves to cause trouble for her.","So Si Nian's exam process went quite smoothly.","But the problem she faced was that she had to return to the family compound.","Perhaps because the exam was already over and they felt there was no need to argue anymore, after giving her the cold shoulder for a few days, Si's Father and Si's Mother stopped blaming her.","After all, the Fu family hadn't mentioned breaking off the engagement.","However, whether she went to college or not, they hoped to set a wedding date.","As long as she got married, who cared what she did.","Besides, what if she didn't even pass?","They didn't really care.","So, a period of time after the college entrance exam, the two families arranged a gathering to discuss this matter in passing.","In the past, Fu Yang would never attend this kind of family gathering. But this time, upon hearing that he hadn't refused, Si's Father and Si's Mother were beaming with joy. They pulled Si Nian aside and urged her to seize the opportunity and get along well with Fu Yang.","Si Nian listened expressionlessly. In the past, under this prolonged verbal pressure, she had become increasingly eager to please Fu Yang, acting more and more cautious around him.","She had been terrified that if she upset him even a little, she would come home to her family's scolding.","At this moment, she felt a bit bewildered.","Did she really like him that much?","Or was it just because Fu Yang's existence allowed her to receive her parents' affection?","Si Nian could no longer tell.","Perhaps her youthful infatuation had faded long ago.","All she had left for Fu Yang was a fear of loss and a sense of dependency.","Because of him, she was no longer just the ordinary Si Nian.","That was probably why she had felt so desperate when she lost his protection and was abandoned by her parents.","For the evening gathering, she didn't even dress up carefully like she used to.","Gone was the impulse; all that remained was perfunctoriness and exhaustion.","Unexpectedly, she really did see him again at the gathering this time.","Fu Yang was as cold and handsome as ever. Wearing a white button-down shirt, with refined facial features, he possessed a mature steadiness that differed from the green youths at school. Although his eyes held a hint of indifference, the more aloof he appeared, the more captivating he was.","Si Nian felt her heart skip a few beats uncontrollably.","Sensing her gaze, Fu Yang shifted his eyes toward her.","Today, she was still wearing the school uniform from that day. The navy collar design gave her an added touch of tranquility and artistic flair, while reducing her usual flamboyant brightness.","She looked exceptionally well-behaved.","So petite.","Just as Fu Yang shifted his gaze, Si Nian had already looked away. She sat calmly beside Si's Father and Si's Mother, listening to them vigorously peddle her as if she were some exquisite commodity.","Because they were attending this gathering, no dinner was made at home, leaving her starving right now.","Si Nian's eyes fell upon the exquisite food on the dining table.","Without drawing attention, she picked up her chopsticks and slowly began to eat.","In the past, Fu Qianqian was the one who grabbed the most food at the table.","Now, she was joining the ranks.","When they finished eating, Fu Qianqian saw that the pile of bones in front of Si Nian was bigger than her own and laughed out of sheer exasperation, Si Nian, were you a starved ghost in your past life?","This remark drew everyone's attention to Si Nian.","The corners of her mouth twitched imperceptibly, and she uttered a maddeningly infuriating remark, Ah, I forgot I'm trying to gain weight lately. I ate a bit too much, but it doesn't matter, I can't get fat anyway.","Fu Qianqian, who was currently on a diet: ??","Normally, Si Nian was very shy in front of outsiders and paid great attention to her image in front of Fu Yang, never eating much.","This time, she was simply too bored.","Since she no longer had to worry about Fu Yang, she naturally let loose and ate her fill.","She accidentally ate too much.","However, she didn't feel embarrassed at all. Her candid remark almost angered Fu Qianqian to death.","Because her college entrance exam didn't go well, it was highly likely she wouldn't get in.","Therefore, she was already preparing to find a job, firmly refusing to listen to her family and use back channels.","She wanted to be a broadcaster; her educational background was sufficient, but they said her image wasn't quite right.","In short, she was too fat.","So Fu Qianqian had recently started dieting.","Si Nian's words were practically stabbing her right in the heart.","She glared in anger.","She immediately threw down her chopsticks and declared she was done eating.","After finishing her meal, Si Nian saw her parents still talking endlessly and felt nothing but annoyance.","Seeing someone else leave first, Si Nian quickly found an excuse to get up and head out, claiming she was going to play with Fu Qianqian, but in reality, she was making her escape.","Fu Qianqian: Hetui~","She planned to stroll around for a bit to digest her food.","Fu Yang had also lost interest. He got up, originally intending to come out and ask Si Nian about her college entrance exam.","It was a major event after all, and there was no harm in him checking in.","But he hadn't expected that while Si Nian said she was coming out to find Fu Qianqian, she was actually keeping her head down and hurrying home...","Si Nian.","He called out subconsciously.","The figure from behind paused for a moment, then walked even faster.","Fu Yang: ?","Fu Yang returned home with a gloomy expression. Seeing him, his parents asked about Si Nian.","Thinking of the woman who had run off without looking back, Fu Yang felt his teeth itch with irritation, but he casually replied, It's getting late, so I let her go back first.","Only then did the two stop asking questions.","Perhaps because Si Nian's recent changes were too drastic, Fu Yang actually had a dream that night.","In the dream, she turned and left as heartlessly as she did today, ultimately taking the arm of another man.","The look in her eyes as she gazed at him held no emotion, only coldness.","Fu Yang stared at her for a very, very long time.","Finally, he came to a conclusion.","No, you are not her.","She was not that Si Nian, not the Si Nian who only had eyes for him.","Who knew that when he uttered these words, a smile would actually appear on the other party's indifferent face.","Fu Yang shuddered and actually jolted awake from the dream.","In the blink of an eye, the exam scores were released.","Si Nian's score, reaching a height that left everyone else in the dust, instantly spread throughout the entire family compound.","She had shockingly achieved the highest score in the entire school.","Not only that, but she was also admitted to Jing University.","When Fu Yang heard this news, he was still training at the military base.","So much so that by the time he returned, Si Nian was already preparing to head to school early to register.","For some unknown reason, this period had passed incredibly quickly, so fast that it didn't even feel real to him.","He couldn't remember anything that had happened.","Yet, he inexplicably had the feeling that Si Nian was slipping further and further away from him.","Even though it was just a dream, and that man hadn't appeared, she was simply becoming more and more like a stranger.","Because Si Nian had gotten into a prestigious university, the Si family had truly made a name for themselves.","Originally, the couple had hoped that Si Nian wouldn't get into college, but unexpectedly, not only did she get in, she got into the best one.","Now, let alone the relatives, the entire family compound came to congratulate them, and even the military leaders showed up.","Si's Father felt a glow of pride on his face and was naturally delighted.","Previously, they had worried that Fu Yang would break off the engagement, always feeling that their family's background wasn't good enough for his. But now that their daughter was a student at Jing University, her status was rising steadily, and naturally, there was no longer any issue of being unworthy.","Si Nian's days had also become much easier as a result.","But she didn't care.","Because she knew very well how her parents, in her past life, had ruthlessly abandoned and schemed against her when their biological daughter returned.","She had long stopped longing for familial affection.","So, taking advantage of her family's good attitude toward her during this time, she immediately proposed going to school early.","Soon, very soon, their biological daughter would be arriving.","She didn't want to fight for anything; she just wanted to stay far away. When the time came, whatever they decided wouldn't matter to her.","Many people came to see her off this time. Not only the relatives from the family compound, but even the members of the Fu family showed up.","Not to mention Fu Yang, even Fu Qianqian was there.","Her expression was somewhat complicated, yet carried a hint of admiration.","In any case, it was weird.","Everyone took turns pulling her aside to say a lot of things, and Si Nian listened earnestly.","Finally, Fu Yang was also called over by the Fu family.","They said they wanted to let the two of them have a good talk.","Fu Yang looked at her. Having not seen her for a while, her aura had settled significantly, and her facial features had changed, becoming more mature.","It gave him an unfamiliar feeling.","Very similar to the one in his dream.","But what was different was.","Fu Yang was very certain.","She was still her, the same Si Nian he had grown up with.","Because no matter how hard she tried to hide it, he was still deep in her eyes.","He looked at her for a long while before speaking in a low voice: \"Do you have nothing to say?\"","Si Nian tugged at the corners of her lips and smiled. \"No, nothing.\"","The words spoken that day had already put an end to their story.","His future belonged to someone else.","She turned around crisply, but Fu Yang suddenly grabbed her hand.","The surroundings fell silent for a long time. Si Nian looked at him in surprise. Fu Yang remained expressionless, his gaze as heavy as a mountain. It lingered for a long moment before drifting down to their clasped hands.","After a moment, he slowly began to smile.","He said, \"Si Nian, I never looked down on you. I just didn't want you to give up your own life because of me.\"","Si Nian paused.","Thinking of her past life, although he had been somewhat cold to her, he wasn't as heartless as he was during that final period.","Because she had given up a bright future just to marry him.","Was that why he had looked down on her so much?","That must be it. He had always admired independence and strength; how could he like someone who gave up everything just to cling to him?","So that was how it was.","Coming back to her senses, Si Nian raised her eyes, looked at him, and said.","\"But Fu Yang, you can't have it both ways.\"","\"I once chose you...\"","\"But I was wrong. So now, I am choosing myself.\"","Fu Yang froze.","Meeting Si Nian's eyes, he felt as though they were filled with a suffocating amount of pain and scars.","Si Nian gently pulled her hand free from his and quietly turned to board the train.","At that moment, Fu Yang felt as if someone had poured strong acid into his heart, melting a bottomless black hole.","Watching her back, panic set in. It felt just like in his dreams—once she left this time, she would never look back.","Just as she boarded, Fu Yang rushed up after her. The entire carriage went quiet. A shadow fell over Si Nian's seat, and the look in her eyes as she stared at him was filled with astonishment.","But meeting the man's impulsive gaze, she stared blankly for a moment before smiling again. With a helpless tone, she asked, \"What are you doing?\"","Fu Yang answered her, \"Does the marriage still count?\"","She was a little surprised but still smiled. \"Seeing that I got into a prestigious university and knowing I'm not useless, do you think highly of me now?\"","Fu Yang pursed his thin lips. \"No.\"","Si Nian touched her chin, thought for a moment, and said, \"If, in four years, I graduate from university and neither of us is married, then it counts.\"","Her gaze was deeply affectionate, a tenderness that left Fu Yang in a daze.","He even had the illusion that they had never ended, that after all the twists and turns, they would eventually come back together one day.","So Fu Yang said okay.","Si Nian left.","She left calmly and with a plan.","No one could make her stay.","Four years?","It was nothing.","She had waited for him for over a decade.","He only had to wait four years; it was nothing.","But why were his eyelids so heavy?","So tired. He suddenly felt so tired. The light in Fu Yang's eyes gradually dimmed, yet his expression grew increasingly gentle.","He saw a ray of sunlight filtering through the trees, reflecting onto a boy and a girl playing around. The lively laughter made it seem as if he had returned to many years ago, when he secretly pulled Si Nian to climb over the school wall. She stood on the wall, opening her arms to him with a trusting voice: \"I'm not afraid, because I know you will catch me.\"","He couldn't sleep; he still had to wait for her.","He would definitely wait for her to come back.","Back to the days when they were childhood sweethearts.","Back then, he wasn't picky and didn't have so many bad habits. He wholeheartedly liked her and only wanted her to be his future partner. Si Nian also only had him; her heart and eyes were full of him.","He didn't have any grand wishes back then; he only hoped she would be happy for the rest of her life.","But he was the one who changed first. He became more and more critical of her. He was the one who demanded she rely on him, yet he was also the first to get annoyed at her clinginess.","Fu Yang opened his eyes.","The sun outside had set. The night air in the Northwest carried a biting chill. The wind howled past his ears, causing the dilapidated tent to flap noisily.","Awakening from a long dream.","As it turned out, his hand had never actually caught hers."]},{"number":507,"title":"Chapter 507: Extra: Wedding Night 1 (Supplement)","paragraphs":["Zhou Yueshen went downstairs to take a shower.","Although there was a bathing area on the second floor, one had to boil water and carry it up themselves.","The Zhou family was wealthy, but since they lived in the countryside, it wasn't as convenient as the city, and the facilities were indeed lacking.","Si Nian usually boiled water and carried it up bit by bit to bathe.","But Zhou Yueshen wasn't that delicate; he simply went downstairs and rinsed off with cold water.","His hair was short, so a casual rub with a towel dried it.","He soon went upstairs, his body still giving off a damp aura.","Opening the bedroom door, Zhou Yueshen saw Si Nian sitting sideways on the chair by the desk, flipping through a book.","She had changed into a nightdress with thin fabric. Under the moonlight, her black hair cascaded over her shoulders, and her eyes were slightly downcast. She lacked the striking, glamorous impact she had during the day, but instead possessed a uniquely delicate and alluring charm.","At this moment, the room was filled with the unique, sweet fragrance of a young woman. Every breath he took was filled with her scent.","The depths of Zhou Yueshen's calm, pool-like eyes grew heated, and his Adam's apple bobbed.","He stepped forward, sat beside her, and with a sweep of his large hand, effortlessly pulled the young woman into his arms. His voice was low: \"What are you reading?\"","Si Nian was somewhat nervous. She gripped the book, but hadn't actually absorbed a single word.","\"Just browsing.\"","Zhou Yueshen reached out and took her book. He cast a glancing eye over it; it was a foreign language book.","He withdrew his gaze, casually tossed the book onto the desk, and suddenly leaned in, capturing her lips in a kiss.","Si Nian was startled and instinctively shrank back.","Zhou Yueshen held her waist, his large hands sinking into her sides as he pressed her down for a straightforward kiss.","When it came to intimacy, this man always held the initiative, leaving Si Nian defenseless.","As their lips and tongues intertwined, the book beside them was accidentally knocked to the floor by her.","Si Nian instinctively tilted her head, wanting to reach out and pick it up.","However, just as she parted from the man's lips, she felt a looseness at her front.","At some point, Zhou Yueshen's fingertips had found their way to her bow.","With a gentle pull.","She hurriedly reached up to cover herself, her eyes misting with a mix of moisture and shyness as she looked at him.","The light was still on, making both of their features clearly visible.","Si Nian's plump lips trembled. She averted her eyes from the man's highly aggressive gaze and spoke in a voice as quiet as a mosquito: \"Turn off the light.\"","Zhou Yueshen watched her quietly for a moment, then suddenly stood up.","Still holding her waist with one hand, he lifted her entire body up with him.","Si Nian instinctively reached out to wrap her arms around the man's neck, pressing her face against his chest.","His bare chest was cool and hard, and only then did she realize how burning hot her own face was.","Zhou Yueshen weighed her in his arms, his eyebrows lifting slightly.","One hand moved upwards, tracing the curve of the young woman's spine until it landed on her slender, soft neck. With a slight pressure, he forced her to tilt her head up again, and he lowered his head to cover her lips.","Maintaining this posture, he walked over to the light switch.","She clung to his neck.","With a click.","The room plunged into silence and darkness.","All that remained was the man's heavy breathing and soft rustling sounds.","Si Nian's eyes hadn't yet adjusted to the dark.","By the time she reacted, Zhou Yueshen had already brought her to sit on the bed.","Her hands instinctively pressed against his shoulders, her arms trembling slightly.","The silky, thin nightdress had long since slipped, hanging loosely off her shoulders.","As her eyes grew accustomed to the darkness, she could faintly make out the shadowy silhouette of the man's features and his bright dark eyes. With his scorching large hands, he only needed to lower his head to easily block her lips.","Their lips and tongues met.","Seeing the young woman go limp as water in his arms, feeling as though she might slip through his fingers if he wasn't careful, Zhou Yueshen tightened his grip.","This man, who had once experienced the hail of bullets on the battlefield and survived near-certain death.","He had witnessed too many life-and-death partings and the hypocrisy of power and profit.","Ultimately, he chose to return to a peaceful life.","He thought this was how his life would be, content with the sole mission of raising his three children.","He never expected that one day, a woman would share his bed.","Through a twist of fate, he had met her.","They had initially come together for their own purposes, but in the course of their ordinary life, they had truly united.","There was no earth-shattering romance, nor any dramatic ups and downs.","Just through simple interactions, it was as if his heart had been stolen. Like a young boy experiencing his first crush, he wanted to show her everything he had.","It felt as though she was meant to be his, that they were always meant to be like this, spending the rest of their years and youth together.","In the dim room, under the moonlight, the rising and falling silhouettes and soft sounds could faintly be seen and heard.","The milk bottle on the desk was accidentally knocked over, and Si Nian let out a cry.","It was the formula prepared for Yaoyao earlier that night. The little girl had eaten a lot today and hadn't finished it.","She immediately got up and said, \"Wait a moment, I'll go change my clothes.\"","Both of them had gotten dirty and smelled of milk.","Zhou Yueshen took a deep breath and set her down.","He opened the window and took a deep breath.","Air rushed into the room, blowing away some of the scorching heat.","In the dim room, under the moonlight, the rising and falling silhouettes and soft sounds could faintly be seen and heard.","The milk bottle on the desk was accidentally knocked over, interrupting the two of them.","It was the formula prepared for Yaoyao earlier that night. The little girl had eaten a lot today and hadn't finished it.","The intimate atmosphere between them was broken, and Si Nian immediately said, \"Wait a moment, I'll go change my clothes.\"","Both of them had gotten dirty and smelled of milk.","Zhou Yueshen took a deep breath and set her down.","Si Nian hurriedly dug out some pajamas and went into the bathroom.","He opened the window and took a deep breath, cleaning up the spilled milk on the floor.","Air rushed into the room, blowing away some of the scorching heat.","\"Zhou Yueshen, help!\"","Si Nian rushed out of the bathroom, clutching her half-worn clothes. She crashed into the man, wrapping her arms and legs around him tightly like an octopus.","Fortunately, Zhou Yueshen was strong and sturdy enough; a normal person would probably have been knocked flying. His heart, which had leaped into his throat out of fright, settled down when he saw she was unharmed. Somewhat amused, he asked, \"What's wrong?\"","Just as Si Nian had taken off her nightgown, a centipede the length of a finger had crawled onto her foot. Terrified, she hopped and leaped, sprinting out of the room at lightning speed.","Si Nian was still in a state of shock, her heart pounding wildly. With her trypophobia, she was utterly terrified of such things and had nearly fainted.","She couldn't even speak clearly, gesturing with her hands just like Second Child: \"It was th-that big...\" She swallowed hard, a look of pure horror on her face: \"A centipede...\"","It was Zhou Yueshen's first time seeing her make such an expression. It was truly adorable, and he couldn't help but let his lips curve upwards into a smile: \"A centipede? Very big?\"","Si Nian nodded vigorously: \"Super big!\"","She had never seen such a huge centipede; she was going to have nightmares tonight.","Why were there centipedes in the house? Why hadn't she noticed them before?","\"The weather is damp. It's true that the countryside has these things. I'll go take a look.\" Zhou Yueshen patted her shoulder and, carrying her, walked toward the bathroom.","Si Nian immediately pulled her head back and buried it low into his chest.","Because they were intimate just moments ago, Zhou Yueshen was still bare-chested.","His lean, muscular body enveloped her, providing a silent sense of security.","Si Nian looked slender when dressed, but she actually had curves in all the right places. She was even much more voluptuous than the average person, with a heavy fullness that was hard to ignore.","However, still reeling from the lingering shock, she was completely oblivious to how intimately close they were.","Zhou Yueshen, on the other hand, was acutely aware of it. The heat he had just managed to suppress instantly rushed downwards. His breath hitched for a couple of seconds, his chest rising and falling involuntarily.","Seeing that Zhou Yueshen was actually going to carry her inside, Si Nian hurriedly struggled to get down.","She was wearing a nightgown made of smooth, slippery fabric. With her sudden movement, Zhou Yueshen almost lost his grip on her.","\"Ah...\"","Her soft cry carried a hint of surprise, laced with an undeniable sweetness.","Then, both of them froze.","Si Nian's heart began to race, a flush creeping up her cheeks before she even realized it.","The lights were still on, and she finally noticed just how suggestive their posture was. \"Zhou... Zhou Yueshen...\"","Zhou Yueshen could have held back, but the way she called his name made him draw in a sharp breath.","A deeply subtle expression flickered across his usually cold and rigid face.","Their bodies were pressed tightly together.","A surge of raw impulse rushed to his head, making his scalp tingle and his body tremble slightly.","Her face burning red, Si Nian buried her head into the crook of the man's neck.","Looking at her like this, Zhou Yueshen felt a tidal wave of emotion crash through him, his gaze growing dark and heavy.","He took two deep breaths in a row, forcefully tamping down the fire inside him, and asked in a husky, restrained voice, \"Are you scared? Go wait for me on the bed?\"","Since her shoes had been kicked off to who-knows-where, Zhou Yueshen simply turned around, carrying her.","Si Nian let out a soft, compliant murmur.","Zhou Yueshen then set her down onto the bed."]},{"number":508,"title":"Chapter 508: Extra: Newlywed Supplement (2)","paragraphs":["Si Nian leaned back on her hands, her body flushed with an unnatural red. With her eyes lowered, she revealed her slender neck.","Zhou Yueshen's Adam's apple bobbed. He forced his gaze away, but inevitably caught a glimpse of that alluring sight.","His scalp tingled, and he felt a rush of heat surging upwards.","\"Hurry up and get rid of that centipede...\" Si Nian urged softly. She was still thinking about the centipede in the bathroom, terrified that it might crawl into her bed while she slept if it wasn't removed.","Zhou Yueshen looked down at himself, then at Si Nian, who was still glancing toward the bathroom.","With a tight jaw, he turned around to deal with the culprit in the bathroom.","When he returned after washing his hands, Si Nian was clutching the blanket and squirming, her face flushed as if she were unwell.","Zhou Yueshen looked down at her. Seeing her awkward expression, he wondered if she was unwilling to let him touch her.","Having been stopped twice in a row, the man was also burning with frustration.","Although he had promised not to touch her before their wedding night.","However, looking at her every day without being able to have her was a kind of torture for him.","Zhou Yueshen didn't want to force her, nor did he want her to be afraid of him. After a moment of silence, he offered,","\"If you aren't ready, I'll go sleep in Little Dong's room.\"","\"Get some good rest.\"","Zhou Yueshen turned to leave after speaking, but Si Nian called out to stop him. Clutching the quilt with her head bowed and her face flushed with embarrassment, she whispered, \"I... I feel a little uncomfortable.\"","Zhou Yueshen paused and looked back at her.","Sitting on the bed with her fragrant shoulders half-exposed, Si Nian's fair, tender arms and slender legs were bare, making it hard to look away.","Si Nian didn't dare meet his eyes, so she missed the complex emotions churning in Zhou Yueshen's gaze.","Zhou Yueshen withdrew his gaze and said in a deep voice, \"I'll go get some medicine.\"","He had been worried about accidentally hurting Si Nian before, as girls were delicate.","He also didn't really know how to please her, so he had prepared in advance.","He just didn't expect the medicine to come in handy before he even started.","\"Sorry for the trouble.\"","Zhou Yueshen quickly returned to the room with a small bottle of ointment in his hand. \"I bought this ointment in the city. It should work.\"","Si Nian nodded repeatedly and reached out to take it.","But Zhou Yueshen refused. He pulled his hand back and said with dark eyes, \"Let me help you.\"","Si Nian froze, her face turning red again.","They were married, so it should be fine, right?","It wasn't that she disliked being intimate with a man, but she was a little afraid of him when he was fierce.","Zhou Yueshen twisted off the cap while staring at her.","Si Nian was wearing a thin nightgown. Although it was relatively conservative, the sheer fabric clung to her body, highlighting her exquisite curves and making it even harder to look away.","Under the man's intense gaze, Si Nian dawdled as she took off her clothes.","Zhou Yueshen glanced down and quickly looked away. His Adam's apple bobbed heavily as he said in a low voice, \"It will be over soon.\"","Si Nian nodded, blushing.","Zhou Yueshen could almost hear his own heart pounding wildly, as if it were going to burst out of his chest. It hammered against his heart beat by beat, making him dizzy.","\"Does it still hurt?\" Zhou Yueshen asked when it was over.","Si Nian shook her head.","\"If it's not uncomfortable, does that mean it feels good?\" A smile played at the corners of Zhou Yueshen's mouth.","Si Nian glared at him.","Seeing her like this, Zhou Yueshen felt a tingling softness in his heart. He wanted to tease her more, but swallowed the words and simply said, \"We are husband and wife. It's no big deal.\"","Si Nian felt too ashamed to face anyone after his words and kicked him.","Unexpectedly, the man was faster. He grabbed her leg, pulled, and smoothly pressed her down.","...","This feast lasted until a white glow appeared on the horizon.","Si Nian was very good at enduring silently, knowing that the house wasn't soundproof and there were many people sleeping inside.","Seeing that the man was endless, she finally cried out \"No\" with a sob. She hit his chest with her hands, which finally made him stop.","She was exhausted and limp; both of them looked as if they had just stepped out of a sauna.","Zhou Yueshen scooped her up in his arms and carried her into the washroom.","There was a vanity mirror in the room, holding quite a few delicate little things—her shampoos, body washes, lotions, and hair oils.","A variety of fragrances filled the air, but they weren't unpleasant.","In the middle was a bathtub, not very large.","Si Nian usually used it to bathe herself and Yaoyao.","The stove in the kitchen was still emitting wisps of heat.","The hot water in the large pot was ready.","With the splashing sound of hot water, Si Nian was gently lowered into the tub.","In an instant, the soothing relief washed away her soreness.","Even though she couldn't open her eyes, she let out a comfortable sigh.","The man watched in amusement as the drowsy woman enjoyed his service.","His rough fingers lifted her chin, and he planted a soft kiss on her lips.","An unknown amount of time passed before the door opened.","Steam and the scent of bath soap flooded into the bedroom.","Si Nian was wrapped in clothes by the man, her small face buried in his chest. Her cheeks were flushed, her full red lips slightly parted, and her breathing was steady.","Her long, fair legs dangled naturally. After the bath, her skin was smooth and silky, and even her nail beds bore a rosy tint.","Zhou Yueshen placed her on the bed. The quilt, specially made for their wedding, was soft and skin-friendly.","The young woman sank into it, the red bedding accentuating her snow-white skin.","His eyes fell on Si Nian.","Her lips were slightly parted, and her body trembled faintly.","Zhou Yueshen pulled the quilt over her to keep her warm.","He casually wiped the moisture from his own body, pulled back the covers, and moved close to her.","The bed was too soft; he wasn't used to sleeping on it.","He pulled her tightly into his arms.","At a casual touch, his hands met smooth, silky skin.","His throat tightened, and his body grew tense.","Si Nian sleepily opened her eyes. Seeming to sense his movements, she looked at him pitifully with misty eyes.","Zhou Yueshen sighed softly, gathered her into his embrace, and gently rubbed her back with his fingertips. He soothed her in a tender voice, \"Don't be afraid. I just want to hold you.\"","That night, however, he did not sleep peacefully. Whether it was because he was holding such a soft, fragrant beauty without being able to touch her further, or for some other reason, he had a very strange dream.","In the dream, Si Nian was always hysterical, looking at him with disgust and hatred.","She even deeply despised the children she currently loved so dearly.","It felt so real that Zhou Yueshen almost believed the current beauty was just a dream of his.","Yet it was clear that just last night, they had been so loving with each other.","Waking up from the nightmare and looking at the woman in his arms, Zhou Yueshen felt a sudden palpitation in his chest.","Startled by him suddenly holding her tighter, Si Nian rubbed her eyes and asked, \"What's wrong?\"","\"Nothing.\" Hearing her soft and gentle voice, Zhou Yueshen found it ridiculous. How could he have such a dream and imagine her to be so awful?","Had his prejudice against her been too deep in the past?","Apologetically, he lowered his head to press a kiss to her forehead and asked, \"Si Nian, you'll always be like this, right?\"","Si Nian froze for a moment. \"Why would you ask that?\"","\"It just feels like you are someone else entirely.\"","Even though she was right in his arms, he always felt she was very far away.","Si Nian's heart skipped a beat.","Her eyes flickered as she said, \"Nonsense, I am just me.\"","However, Zhou Yueshen didn't miss the flash in her eyes. He lowered his gaze and replied, \"Of course you are you.\" The one he liked was her, not the woman in his dream.","Zhou Yueshen was absolutely certain.","If this were a dream, he would rather never wake up for the rest of his life."]},{"number":509,"title":"Chapter 509: New Year's Special: Zhou Zehan Chapter","paragraphs":["2000.","Zhou Yuehan completely cut ties with his foster father. His eldest brother was sent to prison, and his younger sister committed suicide after being humiliated by the blond punk. On this day of family reunion, all his loved ones left him. So when his underlings betrayed him, Zhou Yuehan didn’t even find it strange. When he woke up again, he found himself in an unfamiliar place.","“Second Brother, hurry up and show me the New Year’s money you gave me. Come on, Big Brother already gave me my red envelope first!”","A little Fatty, who didn’t even reach his shoulder, suddenly jumped up and hugged his neck, nearly choking him.","Second Brother?","He had never known he had a younger brother. He only had one sister and one brother—but his sister had died by suicide last year, and his eldest brother had been thrown into prison and lost contact.","Years of rough living had made Zhou Yuehan suspicious and wary of everything around him.","His eyes swept over the room: a spacious space with a desk, bookshelf, computer, and various trophies on the shelf—trophies for sprint champion, swimming first place...","In one photo, he was wearing a tracksuit, standing with a group of strangers.","Zhou Yuehan frowned. He only remembered being betrayed by his men, surrounded by a group of enemies along with a few of his brothers. If things had gone as expected, he should have been dead—and died a miserable death.","How had he woken up in a strange place?","“Second Brother, why aren’t you talking to me?” The little Fatty muttered unhappily. Didn’t someone once say they’d earn a lot of money to spoil their little brother? All lies, boohoo.","Little Four tagged along behind Zhou Yuehan with hopeful eyes. When Zhou Yuehan took a few steps and saw himself in the mirror on the wall, he froze in place.","Was that him?","Where was his red spiky hair? Where was the scar on his face, the mark of a man? Where were the tattoos of the green dragon on his left arm and the white tiger on his right?","How was all of it gone?","The person in the mirror had dark skin, but a clean, close-cropped hairstyle, a handsome, strong face. It was still his face, but his skin had never been this good, his hair never this short. His prized tattoos and scars were missing too. The usual fierceness in his eyes had disappeared, replaced by brightness and vigor.","Zhou Yuehan turned his head to look at the little guy trailing after him like a tail, calling him Second Brother. His voice carried a strange edge. “Kid, what’s your name? Who sent you here?”","Little Four tilted his head, walked closer, and tried to stretch his hand up to his Second Brother’s forehead. Zhou Yuehan frowned and dodged. “Second Brother, are you still feverish? What do you mean ‘kid’? I’m Little Four, your most, most, most, most beloved little brother.”","Younger brother?","He didn’t have any younger brother. This kid must have mistaken him for someone else—didn’t even recognize his own biological brother.","Or maybe—this was just a dream?","Even if it were a dream, he should be dreaming about his sister and eldest brother. How could he randomly dream about a younger brother?","Zhou Yuehan felt everything around him was too strange. He stood up and walked downstairs.","“Xiao Han, you’re up? What’s wrong, still feeling unwell? Come over, let Mom take a look.”","A woman sitting on the sofa spoke in a soft, gentle voice.","The moment he saw her face, his expression changed. “What are you doing here?”","His foster mother—hadn’t she died long ago?","How was she still alive? Thinking of this woman, Zhou Yuehan’s face turned extremely ugly. After she married his foster father, she caused endless trouble and made their lives unbearable. He had grown to hate the way she looked at them with disdain and disgust, as if they were piles of dog shit—one glance was too much. At first, he had hoped things would be different with this foster mother, but her arrival only made their lives more miserable.","His eldest brother had ended up in prison because of her death too.","If it weren’t for her, none of the later events would have happened.","His voice was cold and shocked, which made the man reading a newspaper nearby look over. The man frowned at his younger brother, hearing the disrespect and rudeness toward their mother in Zhou Yuehan’s tone.","Almost immediately, Zhou Zedong looked at his brother with a furrowed brow.","His younger brother had always been solicitous toward their mother; he never looked at her like that.","Little Four broke the strange tension between them. He ran over, grabbed his eldest brother’s hand, and chattered, “Big Brother, Mom, listen to me! Second Brother asked who I am. Don’t you guys think he’s lost his mind? He even forgot his own little brother!”","Zhou Yuehan had been sick with a cold for a few days—probably because of the temperature difference after winning first place in the swimming competition.","When Zhou Yuehan saw the young man on the sofa clearly, his pupils constricted. It was his eldest brother, the one who had been thrown into prison and lost. Now his brother was much taller than in his memory, with fair skin and a handsome face—but instead of the gloominess Zhou Yuehan remembered, his expression was calm and deep, carrying disapproval of how Zhou Yuehan had just spoken.","His eldest brother had hated that woman the most. How could he be glaring at him for being rude to her?","Before Zhou Yuehan could process this, a delicate-looking girl ran down from the second floor, skipping. “Second Brother, you’re awake! Good timing—the whole family’s waiting for you to eat.”","“Go call Dad to dinner,” Si Nian said to the chattering Little Four.","“Shitou and the others should be here too.”","Zhou Yuehan hadn’t even recovered his composure when he saw his foster father—who was supposed to have cut ties with him long ago—walk in from outside. He was wearing a white shirt, his face cold and stern, looking more mature than before but lacking the old indifference, softened by a touch of warmth.","Zhou Yuehan almost thought he was seeing things. He had never imagined the word “gentle” could ever be used to describe this unapproachable foster father.","The little guy who had called him Second Brother grabbed his hand. In the past, Zhou Yuehan had always feared this father and never dared to be so close to him. But now, the boy was tugging on his hand, calling him “Dad.” Only then did Zhou Yuehan notice that this kid actually looked a lot like his foster father.","Was he really his foster father’s biological son?","Before he could react, he heard another commotion from outside. “Second Brother! Are you better? I came to see you!”","A strange young man rushed in, wearing a jersey, with fair skin, thin but handsome and lively. His eyes sparkled as he looked at Zhou Yuehan. He walked over and casually threw an arm around his shoulder like they were good brothers.","Ever since Zhou Yuehan had started his own gang, no one had dared to put an arm around him like that.","Who was this guy—half a head shorter, delicate as a girl?","Then Shitou walked in too, with a sunny, honest face, also in a jersey. “Second Brother, you’re awake! Even though you weren’t there today, we still won the game. I bet those brats won’t dare to fight us for the court anymore.”","Shitou, who had become sullen and quiet after their sister died, was now incredibly cheerful and bright, flashing a smile with white teeth that was almost dazzling.","Behind him stood a man wearing glasses, very refined, with a slight resemblance to his eldest brother. He walked in, glanced at Zhou Yuehan, gave a slight nod, and then walked over to his brother, respectfully calling out, \"Big brother, I'm here.\"","Zhou Zedong withdrew his gaze from his younger brother and gave a slight nod.","Zhou Yuehan looked at the full crowd of people; even a man who had seen all sorts of grand occasions was filled with shock.","How could he have such a strange dream?","And have so many brothers all of a sudden?","Where did all these people come from?","\"Alright, stop messing around. Go wash your hands and eat, celebrating the Second Child winning the swimming competition and getting an invitation to the national youth team.\"","Si Nian stood up. As soon as she spoke, everyone fell silent and obediently lined up to wash their hands. Even Da Huang followed behind them, wagging his tail.","Zhou Yuehan remembered that Da Huang had been poisoned to death.","During the time when his younger sister passed away, their family fell apart.","With no one around the house, someone poisoned Da Huang.","His foster father was busy with work and only found Da Huang dead when he came home.","But now Da Huang was still following them, looking very old—no longer as strong and mighty as before, yet still in good condition.","Not like the dirty, ragged mess from before.","Could it be that in this dream, no one had died, and this was the beautiful life he had imagined?","Zhou Yuehan’s eyes warmed. The family he had lost, the friends he could never see again, were all right there beside him. His cold, dark world seemed to grow bright and warm in that moment.","Everyone sat down to eat. The Second Child, usually the most eager to start eating, was unusually quiet today, which made Si Nian glance at him a few times. \"Xiao Han, have you still not fully recovered? Why aren’t you saying anything today?\"","Zhou Yuehan had always hated Si Nian, but now, meeting her caring and gentle gaze, he somehow couldn’t feel repulsed.","He didn’t know what was wrong, so he just lowered his head and said, \"No, I just feel a bit dizzy.\"","\"Second Brother, when did you become so fragile? When I get sick, I just recover on my own. You’ve been lying down for days,\" Jiang Jiu said proudly. As he spoke, he piled all kinds of fatty meat high into Zhou Yuehan’s bowl, adding, \"Eat more, eat more and you’ll get better.\"","Zhou Yuehan stared blankly. He had brothers around him, quite a few, but no one had ever dared to treat him so casually, let alone put food in his bowl.","Shitou was eating with grease dripping from his mouth, afraid that he might snatch it away. \"If you’re not eating, I’ll finish it all.\"","Zhou Zedong glanced at his younger brother. \"Still feverish?\"","\"No... it’s just that this feels too unreal.\"","Little Four’s aggrieved voice chimed in, \"Mom, Second Brother promised to give me a New Year’s red envelope, but now he won’t.\"","Yao Yao said, \"Second Brother, don’t be too sad. Even though the love letter my classmate wrote was for Big Brother, not for you, there are plenty of fish in the sea. Why pine for one flower alone?\""]}]);
